---
headerPhoto: "5220886"
seoTitle: "Have your say on housing in Sandwell"
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Get involved
heading: Have your say on housing in Sandwell
crumb: Get involved
description: "Ways for Sandwell tenants and leaseholders to get involved: scrutiny group, building safety forum, youth involvement, task and finish groups and TRAs."
lede: Not ready to run a group? There are other ways to get involved, and we can help you find the right one.
ways:
  - title: Tenant and Leaseholder Scrutiny Group
    text: Residents who meet to look closely at housing services and recommend improvements.
  - title: Resident Building Safety Forum
    text: Gives residents in high-rise blocks a say on building safety, including fire, asbestos, gas and water.
  - title: Youth involvement
    text: Makes sure younger tenants and residents are part of the conversation.
  - title: Task and finish groups
    text: Short-term groups set up to help write a specific policy or strategy.
  - title: TRAs and community groups
    text: Bring tenants and residents in a local area together. We can help you start one.
  - title: Volunteering with SCIPS
    text: Interested in helping your community? Get in touch to find out about volunteering with us.
---
<div class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Ways to get involved</h2>
      <p>These are some of the ways Sandwell Council tenants and leaseholders can take part, set out in the council's Tenant Engagement Strategy.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="ruled-grid" style="list-style:none;padding-left:0">
      {% for w in ways %}
      <li><span class="num">{{ "0" + loop.index }}</span><h3>{{ w.title }}</h3><p>{{ w.text }}</p></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-l"><a class="arrow-link" href="{{ site.strategy }}">Read the Tenant Engagement Strategy on sandwell.gov.uk</a></p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section section--stone" aria-labelledby="help-title">
